STATUS

Copy-ready prompt for generating one production background image for the
Urkaaaz Android launch splash. The current approved background is
`assets_src/splash/splash_background.png`; its Android runtime copy is
`android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/splash_background.png`. The app renders
its runic emblem, the live URKAAAZ wordmark, and the supplied AFACODE company
logo as separate UI assets over this background.

REFERENCE INPUTS

- Attach `assets_src/dashboard/dashboard_background_approved.png` as a
  secondary reference for the Urkaaaz game's painterly fantasy finish, warm
  light, and material quality. Do not copy its composition or characters.
- The exact company logo is stored at
  `assets_src/splash/afacode_company_logo.png`. It is rendered by the app as a
  separate, unmodified transparent overlay over a soft warm glow at the
  lower-right. Keep that corner quiet and low-detail. Do not add a plaque or
  opaque backing. Do not draw, regenerate, crop, recolor, distort, or bake the
  company logo into the background image.
- The runic emblem and `URKAAAZ` title are also separate live app layers.
  Leave the central area dark and visually calm enough for them to remain
  legible.

PROMPT

Create one restrained, atmospheric landscape background for the opening
splash screen of Urkaaaz, a colorful fantasy catapult game. The overall
direction is runic minimalism: mysterious and polished, but quiet enough to
support a centered gold rune and wordmark that the application adds separately.

Use a deep charcoal and midnight-navy palette with subtle warm brass-gold
reflections and a faint trace of cool cyan in the shadows. Suggest an ancient
stone surface or distant, barely visible fortress silhouettes through soft
texture and atmospheric depth only. Add a few thin, low-contrast arcane
geometry marks or etched rune-like strokes around the outer composition. Keep
these decorative details sparse, soft, and secondary; do not create another
large standalone rune that competes with the app's centered emblem.

Use a gentle central halo and restrained vignette to create depth without
turning the screen into a bright illustration. Preserve a clear, uncluttered
center for the runtime emblem and `URKAAAZ` wordmark. Keep the lower-right
corner especially simple so the exact transparent AFACODE logo can be
composited there by the app over a soft radial glow. The logo and glow are
separate runtime layers; do not draw a plaque or backplate.

The image is a static background layer, not a finished screenshot. Do not
include any title, logo, word, letter, number, interface, button, loading
indicator, device frame, watermark, or signature. Do not include characters,
catapults, projectiles, battle action, or a busy scene. Favor spacious negative
space, crisp but subtle texture, and a premium fantasy-game finish.

OUTPUT

- Output exactly one file: `splash_background.png`.
- Canvas: exactly 1920 × 1080 pixels, landscape 16:9.
- Use an opaque RGB or RGBA PNG suitable for full-screen Android rendering.
- Fill the entire canvas edge-to-edge; do not add letterboxing, borders, a
  device frame, a mockup, a contact sheet, or alternate versions.
- Keep the central emblem/title area and the lower-right company-logo area
  low-detail and dark enough for the separate runtime overlays.
- Save the generated source file to `assets_src/splash/splash_background.png`.
  The Android runtime copy will be
  `android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/splash_background.png`.

NEGATIVE PROMPT

text, letters, numbers, title, wordmark, logo, AFACODE, watermark, signature,
UI, buttons, loading bar, progress indicator, phone, device frame, mockup,
contact sheet, multiple variants, character, orc, catapult, projectile,
explosion, battlefield action, bright central subject, oversized rune,
competing emblem, dense runes, pseudo-writing, glowing text, highly detailed
castle, busy scenery, saturated rainbow palette, bright cyan glow, excessive
gold bloom, lens flare, strong particles, high contrast behind the title,
bright or detailed lower-right corner, off-center focal subject, gradient-only
generic wallpaper, photorealism, unrelated franchise, copied commercial art

ACCEPTANCE CHECK

1. The output is one full-bleed 1920 × 1080 PNG background, not a screen mockup.
2. Its dark, minimal fantasy atmosphere supports a separate central rune and
   live URKAAAZ title without competing with either.
3. There is no text or logo embedded in the image; the transparent AFACODE
   logo remains an exact separate overlay without an opaque plaque.
4. The lower-right corner is calm enough for the transparent company-logo
   overlay and its soft glow, and the center is calm enough for the app's
   emblem and wordmark.
5. The result uses restrained rune details, warm gold accents, and subtle
   atmospheric depth without a busy battle scene or excessive glow.
